*** REPLACE THIS CHEAP IMITATION LINE WITH A REAL MESSAGE ***

   I was in the same situation once.  DO NOT THROW AWAY YOUR USED UP WAND OF
DIGGING as this is the only reasonable way to get the amulet.  Yes the amulet
is hidden under a rock somewhere on the level.  You must try to determine
where and go there with your used up wand of digging.  If you continue to try
to zap this wand, sooner or later you'll get the following message :

   You wrest one more spell from your worn out wand : What Direction?

   I haven't checked the source to see how often this happens but it may take
50 or more turns.  It can most irritating if you do not have a ring of
teleport control and have munched on a Leppie or two, to try and stay in the
same place long enough to get this message.
